## Improve OBX import naming

Context: Registry imports could only rename a domain when its source folder
already conflicted with an existing domain. Import now exposes an explicit
CamelCase target name for every domain and safely resets graph runtime when
creating a renamed copy.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/helpers/DatabricksHelpers.py
   Added the shared automatic ontology base URI builder.
2. src/back/core/helpers/__init__.py
   Exported the automatic base URI builder through the helper facade.
3. src/back/objects/domain/Domain.py
   Reused the shared URI builder for new-domain identity generation.
4. src/back/objects/domain/SettingsService.py
   Added CamelCase import-name suggestions and rewrote identity while clearing graph runtime for renamed OBX versions.
5. src/front/templates/partials/registry/_import_obx_modal.html
   Added the Import as column and Bootstrap-managed visibility states.
6. src/front/static/registry/js/registry.js
   Added Import-as rendering, validation, duplicate detection, decision derivation, and target-aware action controls.
7. src/front/static/registry/css/registry.css
   Kept the Import as field readable on desktop and mobile table layouts.
8. tests/units/domain/test_domain_service.py
   Covered the shared automatic URI contract.
9. tests/units/settings/test_settings_obx.py
   Covered renamed document preparation, graph reset, suggestions, conflicts, and unchanged overwrite behavior.
10. tests/units/front/test_registry_obx_import_rename.py
    Added structural contracts for the Import-as workflow and responsive field sizing.
11. docs/import-export.md
    Documented Import-as behavior and the graph rebuild requirement.
12. docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-15-obx-import-rename-design.md
    Recorded the approved user experience and backend behavior.
13. docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-15-obx-import-rename.md
    Recorded the test-first implementation plan.

