## Skip app grants during local Lakebase provisioning

Context: The Settings Lakebase provisioning flow always attempted to resolve
Databricks App service principals. Local development authenticates as the
developer identity, so the fallback MCP app lookup failed and stopped provisioning.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/domain/SettingsService.py
   Limited App and MCP service-principal resolution and Unity Catalog grants to Databricks App mode.
2. src/back/core/graphdb/lakebase/provisioner.py
   Made app-principal grant steps optional while preserving user superuser setup.
3. tests/units/settings/test_lakebase_provision.py
   Added regression coverage proving local provisioning completes without resolving or granting app principals.

